// Shared test rig: the REAL Stage 1.1 turn path (createTurnQueue / processTurn / deliver.ts / turn.ts / memory.ts) over a fake Telegram
// transport that sits UNDER grammY's real Api (so GrammyError / HttpError come from the library), a stubbed model (global fetch) and a
